      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think that this feature would be nice as an option for people who want it, but I hate seeing imposters in general, I would much rather not see people load who I don't wish to have loaded, it'd be nice to have animators unload, and the removal of the \" prioritize friends download first\" has made it so people with bad internet simply change their settings to friends only unless manually shown. \n\nLoading a bunch of imposters despite them being small is not great. I would love full animator culling and even the ability to get rid of all the gray diamonds so only the people I have shown exist. \n\nThis is just how I feel about seeing a bunch of people, I'll enable avatars if I wish to enable them. More choice for the users I feel is always a good thing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
